    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Scum_and_Villainy\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Scum and Villainy\">Star Wars Saga Edition Scum and Villainy</a></i></p><p><i>See also:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Feats\" title=\"Feats\">Feats</a></i></p><p>You have an uncanny ability to call upon your reserves when you most need them.</p><p><b>Prerequisite:</b> <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Constitution\" title=\"Constitution\">Constitution</a> 13</p><p><b>Effect:</b> When you catch a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Second_Wind\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Second Wind\">Second Wind</a>, you can choose to regain only half of the Hit Points you normally would with a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Second_Wind\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Second Wind\">Second Wind</a> and immediately Move up to half of your Speed. This movement does not provoke <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Attacks_of_Opportunity\" title=\"Attacks of Opportunity\">Attacks of Opportunity</a>.</p>",
